      "heading": "More Actions: Import & Export",
      "id": "more-actions",
      "intro": "More Actions adalah dialog drawer berukuran besar (1200px) yang menyediakan 2 operasi bulk: Import Stop List (untuk mengimpor data massal dari CSV/JSON) dan Export Stop List (untuk mengekspor selected entries ke CSV).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka More Actions Dialog",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **More Actions** (ikon gear/settings) di toolbar atas main view.\n• Drawer akan membuka dari sisi kanan dengan lebar 1200px untuk workspace yang luas.\n• Dialog memiliki 2 tab: **Import List** dan **Export List**.\n• Badge \"Stop List\" menandakan context operasi yang sedang aktif.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:380px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0f2fe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M12 1v6m0 6v6M5.64 5.64l4.24 4.24m4.24 4.24l4.24 4.24M1 12h6m6 0h6M5.64 18.36l4.24-4.24m4.24-4.24l4.24-4.24\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">More Actions</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Additional operations for import and export stop list data</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#dbeafe;border:1px solid #bae6fd;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;\">● Stop List</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\">📥 Import List</div><div style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #e0f2fe;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#93c5fd;\">📤 Export List</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;min-height:200px;background:#fafbfc;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;\"><div style=\"width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 12px;\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Acquire Source Manifest</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.4;\">Drag and drop your CSV or JSON<br/>registry file here to initialize<br/>the verification pipeline.</div></div></div></div>"
          }
