        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab Import List: Upload & Verification",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n**Workflow Import:**\n1. **Upload File**: Drag & drop atau klik area dropzone untuk memilih file CSV/JSON (max 25MB).\n2. **Verification Center**: Setelah upload, sistem akan parsing file dan menampilkan preview data dalam bentuk card/table dengan checkbox.\n3. **Manifest Integrity Sidebar**: Menampilkan metadata file yang di-upload:\n   - File name & format (CSV/JSON)\n   - Ingestion date\n   - Registry units (jumlah records)\n   - File size\n4. **Select & Finalize**: Centang entries yang ingin di-import, lalu klik **Finalize Import (N)** untuk menyimpan ke database.\n\n> Sistem akan menampilkan loading overlay \"Analyzing Manifest\" saat parsing file dan \"Extracting Registry Metadata\" saat proses import.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(16,185,129,.12);border:1px solid #d1fae5;background:#fff;width:360px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #d1fae5;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#d1fae5);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:2px;\">Import Stop List</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Verify and ingest registry entries</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Finalize Import (4)</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"width:120px;min-width:120px;background:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg>Manifest</div><div style=\"background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M16 13H8m8 4H8m2-8H8\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">stop_list.csv</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#3b82f6;font-weight:600;\">DETECTED</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Units</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">42</div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Size</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">12.4 KB</div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"4\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#10b981;\">Verified</div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;background:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Verification Center</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Metadata ready</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:2px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">4 Selected</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:6px;padding:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:12px;height:12px;accent-color:#3b82f6;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#1 Card Number</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">UNIT READY</div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:6px;padding:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:12px;height:12px;accent-color:#3b82f6;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#2 IP Address</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">UNIT READY</div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-left:3px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;accent-color:#3b82f6;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#3 Email</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">UNIT READY</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tab Export List: Selection & Download",
          "desc": "**Workflow Export:**\n1. **Selection Source**: Main area menampilkan semua Stop List entries yang tersedia dengan checkbox.\n2. **Select Target**: Gunakan checkbox untuk memilih entries yang ingin di-export, atau klik **Select All** untuk memilih semua.\n3. **Packaging Details Sidebar**: Menampilkan informasi export:\n   - Output Strategy: Standard CSV Manifest\n   - Source Registries (total entries)\n   - Selection Target (jumlah yang dipilih)\n   - Extraction date\n   - Export Protocol: HTTPS / CSV\n4. **Finalize Export (N)**: Klik tombol di header untuk download file CSV dengan format nama `stop_list - [timestamp].csv`.\n\n> Export hanya akan mengekstrak entries yang di-centang. File CSV dapat digunakan untuk backup, reporting, atau re-import ke sistem lain."
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Format File Import",
          "desc": "**CSV Format** (recommended):\n```csv\nentityType,value,dateIn,dateOut,reason,isExpired\nCard Number,4111111111111111,2024-01-01 00:00:00,2024-12-31 23:59:59,Confirmed fraud,true\nIP Address,192.168.1.1,2024-01-01 00:00:00,,Known proxy,false\n```\n\n**JSON Format**:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"entityType\": \"Card Number\",\n    \"value\": \"4111111111111111\",\n    \"dateIn\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00\",\n    \"dateOut\": \"2024-12-31T23:59:59\",\n    \"reason\": \"Confirmed fraud\",\n    \"isExpired\": true\n  }\n]\n```\n\n> Field `dateOut` dan `isExpired` bersifat opsional. Jika `isExpired` false, `dateOut` akan di-ignore."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
